          "description": "<ul><li>Life insurance platform for a Japanese client (3 years): coordinated 12 Java developers, wrote 40 basic design documents in Japanese, and handled 150 change requests; UAT defects fell from 45 to 18 per round.</li><li>Warehouse system for a Japanese retailer (1 year): moved the system to .NET 8 with a team of 8 and delivered all 6 releases on schedule.</li><li>Digital banking project for a Japanese client (current, 2 years): analyze requirements and run weekly meetings in Japanese; 90% of specs pass client review the first time.</li><li>Coached 3 developers into BrSE roles; within a year each ran a Japanese client project on their own.</li></ul>"
